  sum rule, or index must protect — a relation, not a temperature.
  The scatter fence stands: an ensemble ratio cannot deliver 6×10⁻⁶
  exactness by itself; the reduction renames the target, it does not
  close it. Next bounded computations, named: (i) does the recorded
  string+log binding give the faces an on-site/bond ratio, and what
